  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is continuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Here,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><msup><mi>e</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>&#956;</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>if&#160;x&#160;&#60;&#160;2&#160;or&#160;x&#160;&#62;&#160;3</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>if&#160;2&#160;&#60;&#160;x&#160;&#60;&#160;3&#160;</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For continuity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>&#956;</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>"
